      <Graphics centerX="705.757080078125" centerY="642.6932373046875" width="90.0" height="25.0" textColor="3955e7" fontName="Arial" fontWeight="Normal" fontStyle="Normal" fontDecoration="Normal" fontStrikethru="Normal" fontSize="12" hAlign="Center" vAlign="Middle" borderColor="3955e7" borderStyle="Solid" borderWidth="1.0" fillColor="FFFFFF" shapeType="Rectangle" />
      <Comment source="xue, PMN, nilo-poyanco">|FRAME: CYCLOARTENOL Cycloartenol| is a precursor for all the steroids produced by plants and diatoms. It is also produced by some prokaryotes, such as the myxobacteria |FRAME: TAX-41| and |FRAME: TAX-43| |CITS: [12519197]|.</Comment>
